/-!
The checked research components of the omega-Y project.

The actual weak-magma omega-Y expansion is well-founded on every legal
input. Representation descent, exact canonical reconstruction and fixed
dimension preservation are connected to the closed theorems in
Expansion.WellFounded. The standard generated domain and each legal root's
descendants are lexicographically well-ordered. Finite executable fixtures
have their own modules and are not imported as proof assumptions.
-/
